        "status": "Pending",
        "stage": "Approved",
        "description": "<div style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>Justification<\/strong><\/div><div style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;<\/div><div style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Further to our engineers recent visit at site, it become apparent that the following in relation to the Fire Alarm System is required and in accordance with British Standards 5839-1: 2017, we would propose the following works to rectify the defects.<\/div><div style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;<\/div><div style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">We recommend these works be carried out as soon as possible as not all areas of the system can be guaranteed to work correctly in the event of a fire.<\/div><div style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;<\/div><div style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>Scope&nbsp;<\/strong><strong>of Works<\/strong><\/div><div style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;<\/div><div style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">We would carry out the following fire alarm remedial works:&nbsp;<\/div><div style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;<\/div><div style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">1 -&nbsp;We would supply and install a key switched fused connection unit, including associated fireproof cable between the connection unit and the fire alarm panel, for the mains supply to the main fire alarm panel, so as to prevent accidental tampering of the fire alarm power supply and to allow for safe testing.<\/div><div style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;<\/div><div style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">2 - We would attend site to trace and identify the correct zones for the fire alarm system including mapping out site so as to produce a graphical zone plan. Once completed we will return to site to mount the framed zone plan adjacent to the main fire alarm panel. Please note: If editable CAD drawings are provided prior to our attendance we may be able to reduce the cost of mapping out site.<\/div><div style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;<\/div><div style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Upon completion the works will be tested.&nbsp;<\/div><div style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;<\/div><div style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">We have allowed for these works to be carried out during normal working hours.&nbsp;<\/div>",
        "cost_center_name": "Small Works - Fire",
        "value": 568.61,
        "date_expiry": "2021-04-29",
        "note_id": 17256,
        "note": "<strong>To:<\/strong> &lt;rmoffat@pfsltd.co.uk&gt;<br><strong>Cc:<\/strong> &lt;dstratton@pfsltd.co.uk&gt;<br><strong>PFS Group Quotation: Reference No. 52648 | Description: Fire Alarm Remedial Works | Site: Denman House, London, London, N16 0JD<\/strong> <br><div style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><div style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Hi Ryan,&nbsp;<\/div><div style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;<\/div><div style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Attached Denman House quote&nbsp;<\/div><br><br>Regards,<\/div><div style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><br><strong>Daniel Stratton<\/strong><br>Estimator<br><strong>P:<\/strong> 0345 565 1887 | <strong>W:<\/strong> www.pfsltd.co.uk | <strong>A:<\/strong>&nbsp;21 Towerfield Road Southend-on-Sea, Essex, SS3 9QE<br><br><\/div>",
